&lt;li&gt;Achieve and exceed sales targets and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about industry trends and competitive landscape to effectively position Twilio&#39;s offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
