&lt;li&gt;Wear the Customer Shoes: Provide onboarding support for common customer inquiries through slack in addition to Service now; to ensure customers have an excellent experience with Twilio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw the Owl: Assess the nature of product or service issues and resolve basic level problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ruthlessly Prioritize: Log customer interactions and tag/categorize issues accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
