&lt;li&gt;You’re introspective and committed to continuous self-improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re capable of working independently but also energized from working within a team and cross-functionally to achieve the company&#39;s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re able to complete tasks in core areas within SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
