&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work a non-traditional schedule; weekends, holidays and evenings may be required (Sunday to Thursday or Tuesday to Saturday 9am-6pm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast paced, ambiguous environment, with a strong bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in customer service or customer facing role requiring effective and empathetic communication&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of SQL, Looker, Tableau or similar data extraction and data visualization tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding APIs and related technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years experience working in a queue based/contact center environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
