&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect role for a marketer with 4–6 years of experience who understands the fundamentals of B2B marketing and channel dynamics, and is ready to take full ownership of partner-facing initiatives. If you are a strong project manager, a collaborative relationship-builder, and data-driven, you will thrive in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign Development&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Campaign Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work collaboratively to create&amp;nbsp; campaigns that touch all stages of the buyer’s journey, from awareness to conversion, including joint webinars, customer events, co-created content, etc..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email Nurture Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and optimize post-event and post-campaign email nurture programs to execute a comprehensive, multi-touch engagement strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Stories:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-author customer success stories featuring strategic partners for both external marketing promotion and internal sales enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tri-Party Plays:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of bundled technology playbooks and build robust, market-ready use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Comms Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joint PR and Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Help define and implement joint PR, whitepapers, and thought leadership pieces to elevate our shared brand presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and manage the Twilio Partner Social Media Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; in alignment with Twilio Corporate plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Campaign &amp;amp; Program Coordination and Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-Led Events:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the execution of partner-hosted campaigns: webinars, regional field events with partners, and customer workshops, including content alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Conference Program Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in coordinating our co-presence with partners at major industry trade shows, managing joint booth presence, logistics, and ancillary partner networking events with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4–6+ years of experience in Partner Marketing, Channel Marketing, or B2B Demand Generation within the B2B tech/SaaS space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of multi-channel demand generation, event execution, and content marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Salesforce (SFDC) and marketing automation platforms (e.g., HubSpot, Marketo) is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing or assisting with MDF (Market Development Funds) and budget tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional organizational skills with a proven ability to juggle multiple campaigns, events, and partner deadlines simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to confidently collaborate with external partner stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote,&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;but is not eligible to be hired in CA, CT, NJ, NY, PA, WA.&lt;/p&gt;
