&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Summit/Events Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a core coordinator for our annual Partner Summit/PABs etc., managing project timelines, registration tracking, vendor communications, and on-site or virtual logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
