&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next &lt;strong&gt;Principal Price Realization Strategy Manager - Digital &amp;amp; PLG Pricing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role, critical to driving Twilio&#39;s pricing strategy and developing key pricing strategic decisions. Your work will directly contribute to accelerating Twilio&#39;s business growth while simplifying the purchasing experience for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Principal Price Realization Strategy Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive the pricing strategy, analytics, and operational execution for our digital and product monetization initiatives. Reporting directly to the Director of Price Realization Strategy, you will serve as a strategic leader responsible for shaping global pricing and discounting frameworks, build and design executive-facing dashboards, and optimizing revenue performance across our entire product portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape &amp;amp; Drive Pricing Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and execute price optimization models that accelerate business performance. You will blend price elasticity, competitive differentiation, and deep financial analysis into actionable monetization frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead PLG &amp;amp; Self-Service Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner directly with Growth Marketing, Self-service Sales, Console Engineering, and Finance teams to align on product-led growth (PLG) strategies, ensuring seamless pricing execution across digital touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the design, optimization, and scaling of advanced pricing analytics dashboards (Tableau/Looker) and operational workflows. Turn complex data infrastructure into strategic tools that enhance efficiency and maximize profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Deep-Dive Data Insights: &lt;/strong&gt;Query and analyze complex datasets across sales, customer behavior, product usage, and financials to uncover hidden revenue opportunities, pressure-test hypotheses, and scale high-impact strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a critical bridge and internal champion across GTM Strategy, Product, Sales, Marketing, and Finance to ensure organizational alignment and flawless execution of new pricing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
