&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Pricing &amp;amp; Localization: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with navigating regional pricing dynamics, including multi-currency strategies, local market nuances, and regulatory constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Consulting experience, MBA or an advanced degree in a highly quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
