&lt;p&gt;The role sits within Twilio’s Corporate Communications team, which is responsible for shaping and delivering Twilio’s story to media, customers, industry analysts, and employees. You will collaborate closely with partners across Social Impact, People, Investor Relations, Legal, Brand, and Corporate Communications to craft compelling external narratives that generate press coverage and awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
