&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Employer Brand PR:&lt;/strong&gt; In partnership with the People team, drive awareness of Twilio as a great place to work by spotlighting the company’s people, values, and culture through proactive external storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own External CAO Communications: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and execute a comprehensive external communications strategy for Twilio’s Chief Administrative Officer, inclusive of media opportunities, thought leadership, speaking engagements, and LinkedIn social presence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
