&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong writing, editing, and storytelling skills&lt;/strong&gt; with executive judgment and the ability to capture a specific leader&#39;s authentic voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong business acumen and financial communications experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally with a publicly traded company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
