&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional organizational skills&lt;/strong&gt; with a calm-under-pressure demeanor and the ability to manage competing priorities on tight timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong collaborative skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven ability to work with multiple cross-functional partners simultaneously.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
