&lt;li&gt;Experienced in establishing and managing sales operating rhythms, including business reviews, QBRs, and forecasting processes, while leveraging data-driven insights to inform recommendations and drive business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to advanced experience navigating sales systems and reporting tools, specifically Salesforce, Excel, SQL, Looker, Gong, and Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
