&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide evidence-based recommendations to the VP of Marketing and the broader marketing organization. Your insights will inform adjustments in our marketing strategies, ensuring they are aligned with our regional revenue goals and broader company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with sales strategy and analytics, global marketing, and customer engagement teams to ensure a cohesive and integrated approach to market analysis and strategy implementation. As a bridge between data and strategy, your role will be pivotal in fostering internal solid partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Optimisation&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion using advanced analytics, marketing technologies, and data-driven insights to fuel innovation within our marketing practices. Your forward-thinking mindset will contribute to our continuous quest for excellence in customer engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
