&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Technical Stack: &lt;/strong&gt;Mastery of complex SQL and proficiency in Python (or R) for data extraction, manipulation, statistical analysis, and pipeline automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Visualization &amp;amp; BI: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record building enterprise-grade executive scorecards and self-serve dashboards in Tableau and Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM &amp;amp; GTM Tech Stack Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong functional understanding of Salesforce (SFDC) data architecture, campaign hierarchies, lead routing rules, and marketing automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen &amp;amp; Executive Presence: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional communication skills with demonstrated experience partnering directly with Director/VP-level leaders to turn data insights into operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
