&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with customer data platforms and intent tools (e.g., Segment, 6sense, Marketo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Marketing Modeling, multi-touch attribution, and lifetime value (CLV/LFTV) analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git/GitHub workflows for analytics version control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion or prior experience in the social impact, non-profit, or public sector technology domains.&lt;/li&gt;
