&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software development experience, with a focus on data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of architecting and delivering complex, large-scale data projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in big data components such as Kafka, Clickhouse, Spark and other distributed computing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise with orchestrating, scaling, and managing containerized applications in production environments using Kubernetes (K8s) and Terraform/Helm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and operating large-scale data platforms on cloud computing systems like AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, Java, Bash, and Go with strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to influence technical roadmaps and drive alignment across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience in mentoring and developing engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment and deliver high-impact results.&lt;/li&gt;
